
### 🍕 Scenario: Restaurant Food Menu

A restaurant wants to store the names of **9 food items** available on its menu.

Create a `String` array and store:

```text
Pizza
Burger
Biryani
Dosa
Idly
Pasta
Noodles
Sandwich
Ice Cream
```

### Tasks

1. Create an array to store the 9 food items.
2. Store all food names in the array.
3. Use a **for loop** to display all food items.
4. Use a **for-each loop** to display all food items.
5. Display the food item at **index 4**.
6. Display the **total number of food items**.
